From 0c02a4eb07acafd76c3b2e25551e9d478b1d8b28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:18:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): transcript prefetch rides warm remote pool
 entries passively [daveey]

The remote prewarmer already dials and holds every SSH gateway (same pool key,
conn:<id>::default). Prefetch now passes passive for remote connections, so it
never starts a cold SSH dial or spawn, never bumps lastActiveAt, and never
records a profile as opened. The local backend may still be started.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../electron/transcript-cache-host.test.ts    | 79 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../desktop/electron/transcript-cache-host.ts | 11 ++-
 2 files changed, 88 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/electron/transcript-cache-host.test.ts

diff --git a/apps/desktop/electron/transcript-cache-host.test.ts b/apps/desktop/electron/transcript-cache-host.test.ts
